"unregister", "unregisters", "unregistered" are verbs.
The verb "unregister" is the 1st form of the verb "unregister".
The verb "unregistered" is the 2nd form of the verb "unregister".
The verb "unregistered" is the 3rd form of the verb "unregister".
The verb "unregisters" is the 3rd person form of the verb "unregister".


To register someone to a community.
    /*FIXME:Ask the registrar of the community to register that someone to the community.*/
End.

To unregister someone from a community.
    /*FIXME:Ask the registrar of the community to unregister that someone from the community.*/
End.

